define('taoQtiItem/qtiXmlRenderer/renderers/Figure',['context', 'tpl!taoQtiItem/qtiXmlRenderer/tpl/figure', 'tpl!taoQtiItem/qtiXmlRenderer/tpl/element'], function (context, figureTpl, elementTpl) {
  var DISABLE_FIGURE_WIDGET = context.featureFlags && context.featureFlags.FEATURE_FLAG_DISABLE_FIGURE_WIDGET;
  return {
    qtiClass: 'figure',
    template: DISABLE_FIGURE_WIDGET ? elementTpl : figureTpl,
    getData(figure, data) {
      var ns = figure.getNamespace();
      if (ns && ns.name) {
        data.tag = "".concat(ns.name, ":figure");
      }
      if (!DISABLE_FIGURE_WIDGET && !figure.attr('showFigure')) {
        data.tag = 'img';
        var cleanImg = data.body.split('<qh5:figcaption');
        data.body = cleanImg[0];
      }
      return data;
    }
  };
});
