define('taoQtiItem/qtiXmlRenderer/renderers/PortableInfoControl',['tpl!taoQtiItem/qtiXmlRenderer/tpl/portableInfoControl', 'taoQtiItem/qtiItem/helper/util', 'taoQtiItem/qtiXmlRenderer/helper/portableElementTpl'], function (tpl, util) {
  'use strict';

  return {
    qtiClass: 'infoControl',
    template: tpl,
    getData: function getData(infoControl, data) {
      data.markup = infoControl.markup;
      if (!infoControl.attr('id')) {
        infoControl.attr('id', util.buildId(infoControl.getRootElement(), infoControl.typeIdentifier));
      }
      return data;
    }
  };
});
